INSERT INTO `faqs` VALUES (1,'About DIT Studio','What is Triangle Interior Design?','Triangle Interior Design is a leading interior design company in Bangladesh, founded in 2015. We specialize in home interior design, custom furniture, kitchen design, bedroom design, bathroom design, landscape design, and more. With 10+ years of experience and 500+ completed projects, Triangle Interior Design is trusted by homeowners across Bangladesh for delivering premium interiors on time and within budget.',1,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(2,'About DIT Studio','When was Triangle Interior Design established?','Triangle Interior Design was established in 2015. Since then, we have grown into one of the most recognized and trusted interior design firms in Bangladesh, completing over 500 residential and commercial projects.',2,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(3,'About DIT Studio','How many projects has Triangle Interior Design completed?','Triangle Interior Design has successfully completed 500+ interior design projects across Bangladesh, including apartments, duplex homes, villas, offices, and commercial spaces. Our growing portfolio covers projects in Dhaka, Chittagong, Sylhet, and other major cities.',3,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(4,'About DIT Studio','How many interior designers work at Triangle Interior Design?','Triangle Interior Design has a dedicated team of 30+ certified designers, 3D visualizers, project managers, and skilled craftsmen — all working under one roof to deliver your dream home from concept to completion.',4,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(5,'About DIT Studio','What is Triangle Interior Design’s trade license number?','Triangle Interior Design is a legally registered business in Bangladesh. Our Trade License number is TRAD/DNCC/032828/2025, issued by the Dhaka North City Corporation.',5,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(6,'About DIT Studio','Where is Triangle Interior Design’s office located?','Triangle Interior Design’s main office is located at: House 127 (2nd Floor), Road 05, Mohakhali New DOHS, Dhaka 1206, Bangladesh. You can also find us on Google Maps for easy navigation.',6,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(7,'About DIT Studio','Where is Triangle Interior Design’s factory located?','Our furniture manufacturing and production factory is located at: 1920, Koborsthan Road, East Badda, Dhaka 1212, Bangladesh. This is where all our custom furniture and woodwork is crafted.',7,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(8,'About DIT Studio','How can I contact Triangle Interior Design?','You can reach Triangle Interior Design through the following channels — Office Phone: 01904654712 | Office Email: info.ditbd@gmail.com | Factory Phone: 01611644811 | Factory Email: factory@ditinterior.com | WhatsApp: 01904654712 | Social MediFacebook, LinkedIn, YouTube, Pinterest. You can also fill out the contact form atditstudio.com.bd/contact/to book a free consultation.',8,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 09:07:31'),(9,'About DIT Studio','Does Triangle Interior Design have a WhatsApp number?','Yes. You can reach Triangle Interior Design directly on WhatsApp at +8801904654712. Our team is available to answer your queries, share design ideas, and schedule site visits.',9,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 09:07:31'),(10,'About DIT Studio','What are Triangle Interior Design’s business hours?','Triangle Interior Design’s team is available during regular business hours, Saturday through Thursday. For the most accurate schedule or to book an appointment, please call us at 01904654712 or message us on WhatsApp.',10,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 09:07:31'),(11,'Services & Process','What interior design services does Triangle Interior Design offer?','Triangle Interior Design provides a complete range of home and commercial interior design services including: Bedroom Interior Design, Living Room Design, Open Kitchen Design, Modular Kitchen Design, Traditional Kitchen Design, Common Space Design, Bathroom Design, Landscape Design, Custom Furniture Design, and Full Home Interior Design. We handle every aspect of your project from concept to final handover.',11,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(12,'Services & Process','Does Triangle Interior Design offer custom furniture design?','Yes. Custom furniture design is one of Triangle Interior Design’s core strengths. We design and manufacture bespoke furniture tailored to your space, lifestyle, and aesthetic preferences. All furniture is produced at our own factory in East Badda, Dhaka, ensuring quality control at every stage.',12,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(13,'Services & Process','Does Triangle Interior Design do commercial interior design?','Yes. In addition to residential projects, Triangle Interior Design designs interiors for commercial properties including offices, showrooms, and retail spaces across Bangladesh. Contact us for a customized commercial design consultation.',13,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(14,'Services & Process','Does Triangle Interior Design provide 3D visualization before starting work?','Absolutely. Every Triangle Interior Design project includes detailed 3D renderings, mood boards, material samples, and full furniture plans. You get to see exactly how your home will look before any physical work begins, ensuring complete satisfaction before we proceed.',14,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(15,'Services & Process','Do you provide end-to-end project management?','Yes. Triangle Interior Design handles everything from the initial site visit and concept design, to material procurement, civil work coordination, custom furniture production, installation, and final styling. You have a dedicated project manager throughout, ensuring a stress-free experience from start to finish.',15,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(16,'Services & Process','What is Triangle Interior Design’s interior design process?','Our 8-step interior design process includes: Nothing moves forward without your full approval at every stage.',16,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(17,'Services & Process','How much does interior design cost in Bangladesh?','The cost of interior design in Bangladesh depends on the size of your home, scope of work, materials selected, and level of customization required. Triangle Interior Design provides transparent, itemized quotations for every project with no hidden costs. Contact us for a free estimate tailored to your specific needs and budget.',17,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(18,'Services & Process','Does Triangle Interior Design charge for consultations?','No. Triangle Interior Design offers a free initial consultation with no obligation. You can contact us via phone, WhatsApp, or the website form to schedule your free session. Our design consultants will listen to your needs, assess your space, and provide initial guidance at no cost.',18,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(19,'Services & Process','Are there hidden charges in Triangle Interior Design’s pricing?','No. Triangle Interior Design believes in completely transparent, upfront pricing. Before any work begins, you receive a detailed quotation with a clear breakdown of all costs. There are no surprise charges or hidden fees — ever.',19,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(20,'Services & Process','Does Triangle Interior Design work within a fixed budget?','Yes. Triangle Interior Design designs beautiful, functional interiors across a wide range of budgets. Our team works closely with you to understand your financial limits and delivers the best possible design within that budget, without compromising on quality.',20,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(21,'Costs & Quality','How long does a home interior design project take?','A typical home interior design project at Triangle Interior Design takes 45 to 90 days, depending on the size and complexity of the space. We provide a clear project timeline before work begins and keep you updated at every stage of the process.',21,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(22,'Costs & Quality','Does Triangle Interior Design guarantee on-time delivery?','Yes. On-time delivery is one of Triangle Interior Design’s core commitments. Our structured project timelines, proactive communication, and experienced craftsmen ensure that every deadline is met. We coordinate closely with suppliers to eliminate the risk of delays.',22,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(23,'Costs & Quality','What happens if my project is delayed?','Triangle Interior Design takes project delays very seriously. Our project management system is built around strict phase-by-phase timelines. In the rare event of a delay caused by material supply, we proactively communicate with you and adjust the plan to minimize any impact.',23,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(24,'Costs & Quality','What type of materials does Triangle Interior Design use?','Triangle Interior Design sources premium, internationally recognized materials that meet global safety and sustainability standards. We partner exclusively with trusted material brands to ensure every finish, fitting, and fixture delivers lasting quality and aesthetic appeal.',24,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(25,'Costs & Quality','Does Triangle Interior Design import materials?','Yes. Triangle Interior Design imports selected premium materials that align with international safety and sustainability standards. This ensures your home interior not only looks beautiful but stands the test of time against everyday wear and use.',25,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(26,'Costs & Quality','What is Triangle Interior Design’s design philosophy?','Triangle Interior Design’s design philosophy is ‘Quality Produces Luxury.’ We believe that great interior design goes beyond aesthetics — it’s about how a space makes you feel every day. Every decision, from materials to furniture to layout, is guided by this commitment to excellence.',26,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(27,'Costs & Quality','Does Triangle Interior Design work outside Dhaka?','Yes. Triangle Interior Design provides interior design services across all major divisions of Bangladesh including Chittagong, Sylhet, Rajshahi, Khulna, Barishal, Rangpur, and Mymensingh. We offer both on-site and remote design consultation options based on your location.',27,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(28,'Costs & Quality','Which areas in Dhaka does Triangle Interior Design serve?','Triangle Interior Design serves all major areas within Dhaka, including Gulshan, Bashundhara, Mirpur, Dhanmondi, Uttara, Mohammadpur, Badda, Mohakhali, Keraniganj, Maona (Gazipur), and all surrounding locations.',28,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(29,'Costs & Quality','Can Triangle Interior Design visit my home outside Dhaka for a site survey?','Yes. Triangle Interior Design’s design consultants can visit your property anywhere in Bangladesh for a site survey and consultation. Contact us at 01904654712 or via WhatsApp to schedule a visit at a time convenient for you.',29,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 09:07:31'),(30,'Costs & Quality','Why is Triangle Interior Design considered the best interior design company in Bangladesh?','Triangle Interior Design has built its reputation through 10+ years of consistent quality delivery, 500+ successfully completed projects, internationally sourced materials, fully transparent pricing, and a dedicated team of some of the best interior designers in Bangladesh. Our client reviews and track record speak for themselves.',30,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(31,'Costs & Quality','Can I see Triangle Interior Design’s past projects?','Yes. You can browse Triangle Interior Design’s full project portfolio at ditstudio.com.bd/projects. The gallery showcases completed projects across Dhaka and other cities, including living room designs, bedroom makeovers, kitchen transformations, and full-apartment renovations.',31,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(32,'Costs & Quality','Does Triangle Interior Design have client testimonials?','Yes. Triangle Interior Design has genuine client reviews and testimonials from homeowners across Bangladesh. You can read these on our website at ditstudio.com.bd and also find project transformation videos on our YouTube channel @ditstudiobd.',32,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(33,'Costs & Quality','Is Triangle Interior Design active on social media?','Yes. You can follow Triangle Interior Design on Facebook (dit.interior), LinkedIn (design-idesa-technology-dit), YouTube (@ditstudiobd), Pinterest (dit_interior), and connect via Facebook Messenger and WhatsApp. We regularly share design inspiration, project updates, and behind-the-scenes content.',33,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(34,'Costs & Quality','Who are the best interior designers in Bangladesh?','Triangle Interior Design is recognized as one of the best interior design firms in Bangladesh, with a team of 30+ certified designers and 10+ years of hands-on experience. Our designers specialize in contemporary, modern, luxury, and functional home interiors across residential and commercial projects.',34,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(35,'Costs & Quality','Which is the best interior design company in Dhaka?','Triangle Interior Design, headquartered in Mohakhali New DOHS, Dhaka, is widely considered one of the best interior design companies in Dhaka. With 500+ completed projects, transparent pricing, and end-to-end project management, Triangle Interior Design is the top choice for homeowners in Dhaka.',35,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(36,'Costs & Quality','How do I choose the right interior design company in Bangladesh?','When choosing an interior design company in Bangladesh, look for: Triangle Interior Design checks all these boxes.',36,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(37,'Costs & Quality','What is the interior design process in Bangladesh?','A professional interior design process in Bangladesh typically involves: free consultation, site survey, concept design with 3D visualization, client approval, material sourcing, execution by skilled craftsmen, and final handover. At Triangle Interior Design, we follow a structured 8-step process to ensure your dream home is delivered perfectly.',37,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(38,'Costs & Quality','Can I get an e-catalogue from Triangle Interior Design?','Yes. Triangle Interior Design offers a free downloadable e-catalogue featuring our design concepts, material selections, furniture collections, and service packages. You can download it directly fromditstudio.com.bdon the homepage.',38,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22');
