e in custom dimensions, colors, and premium finishes upon request.','images/emerald-r3618-300x300.jpg','[\"images\\/emerald-r3618-300x300.jpg\"]','Standard / Customizable','Gorjon Ply, Action TESA HDF / Marine Board, Blum Hardware',1,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(4,'Hafele ARGENTO SAPPHIRE R3618 Double Bowl Sink','hafele-argento-sapphire-r3618-double-bowl-sink','Custom Furniture',3790000.00,'37,900.00৳',3411000.00,'DIT-PVJXV','in_stock','Premium quality Hafele ARGENTO SAPPHIRE R3618 Double Bowl Sink handcrafted by Triangle Interior Design custom furniture workshop.','Premium quality Hafele ARGENTO SAPPHIRE R3618 Double Bowl Sink handcrafted by Triangle Interior Design custom furniture workshop.\n\nEach item is custom manufactured in our West Badda facility under rigorous architectural oversight. Available in custom dimensions, colors, and premium finishes upon request.','images/Sapphire-R3618-Kitchen-Sink-300x300.webp','[\"images\\/Sapphire-R3618-Kitchen-Sink-300x300.webp\"]','Standard / Customizable','Gorjon Ply, Action TESA HDF / Marine Board, Blum Hardware',1,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22'),(5,'Hafele Topaz R2418D','hafele-topaz-r2418d','Custom Furniture',2490000.00,'24,900.00৳',2241000.00,'DIT-TST5L','in_stock','Premium quality Hafele Topaz R2418D handcrafted by Triangle Interior Design custom furniture workshop.','Premium quality Hafele Topaz R2418D handcrafted by Triangle Interior Design custom furniture workshop.\n\nEach item is custom manufactured in our West Badda facility under rigorous architectural oversight. Available in custom dimensions, colors, and premium finishes upon request.','images/topaz-r2418D-300x300.avif','[\"images\\/topaz-r2418D-300x300.avif\"]','Standard / Customizable','Gorjon Ply, Action TESA HDF / Marine Board, Blum Hardware',1,'2026-10-13 00:00:22','2026-10-13 00:00:22');
